@startuml
' Genesis Protocol — Campaign lifecycle state machine
[*] --> Uninitialized
Uninitialized --> Mounting : selectCampaign(campaign_id)
Mounting --> Hydrating : projectionRequested
Mounting --> Error : requestFailed
Hydrating --> Ready : [campaign_id matches]\n[epoch matches]\n[projection valid]
Hydrating --> StaleResponseDiscarded : [epoch mismatch]
Hydrating --> Error : [projection invalid]
StaleResponseDiscarded --> Mounting : awaitCurrentRequest
Ready --> Switching : selectDifferentCampaign()
Switching --> Mounting : incrementMountEpoch()
Ready --> RestartConfirmation : restartFromOpening()
RestartConfirmation --> Ready : cancel
RestartConfirmation --> Restarting : confirm
Restarting --> Mounting : backupComplete\nresetComplete
Ready --> Refreshing : backgroundRefresh()
Refreshing --> Ready : newRevisionCommitted
Refreshing --> Ready : refreshFailed\nretainOldProjection
Error --> Mounting : retry()
Error --> [*] : closeApplication()
Ready --> [*] : closeApplication()
@enduml
